# Economy → Investments as one list (Options → Feature flags → "Investments list and research"):
# the game's two lists, their titles and the Total value bar are hidden and one list takes their
# place, with filter sub tabs (All, Owned, Orders, Local, Locked), the Stock Monitor's sort and its direction.
# All is one list sorted as a whole; only the Group button splits it into sections. Assumes
# nothing about what the city holds. Flag off gives the game's tab back.
name investments list: one list in place of the two, tabs, group, sort, and back
# the list keeps its own sort and pills' unit, separate from the Stock Monitor unless Options
# says to follow it: set here, both put back after
monitor remember
monitor-sort Change
monitor-change percent
investments-sort sync off
investments-sort Change
close-economy
investments-list on
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-hidden InvestmentsPanel
expect-hidden OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-hidden OwnedInvestmentsSummaryPanel
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-All All
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort Sort: Change %
capture investments-list-all
# two columns: on the right a sub tab group picks the view (Market built, the rest disabled)
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverview
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketChart
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketBreadth
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverview FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsView
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTabs FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Feed
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarket
# a click on the index's pill (or any pill) shows them all in points: ₡ for the fund
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketChange %
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketChange
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketGainer-0Change ₡
capture investments-overview-market-points
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketGainer-0Change
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketChange %
expect-hidden BuySellInvestmentPanel
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketRange-7
wait 0.5
capture investments-overview-market-7d
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarketRange-30
wait 0.5
# the Portfolio view: value, today and gain, the holdings' chart, the donut, the open orders
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Portfolio
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolio
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarket
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioValue ₡
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioChart
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolio
capture investments-overview-portfolio
# the longest order text of each kind wraps inside its row; rows stop before the bottom edge
overview-orders longest
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-0
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolio
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-0Side FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-0Text
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-0Symbol FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-0Cancel
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-1Side FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-1Text
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-1Symbol FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-1Cancel
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-2Side FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-2Text
expect-no-overlap FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-2Symbol FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewPortfolioOrder-2Cancel
capture investments-overview-portfolio-longest-orders
overview-orders off
wait 0.5
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewTab-Market
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsOverviewMarket
# separate: the Monitor in ₡ and sorted by symbol leaves the list as it was
monitor-change currency
monitor-sort Symbol
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort Sort: Change %
# synced (Options): the list follows the Monitor
investments-sort sync on
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort Sort: Symbol
investments-sort sync off
monitor-sort Change
monitor-change percent
wait 0.5
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
# All is not split into sections until Group is pressed
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsHeading-All
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsHeading-Portfolio
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup Group
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup Ungroup
capture investments-list-grouped
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup
wait 0.5
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsHeading-All
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-Owned
wait 0.5
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-Orders
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-Orders Orders
capture investments-list-orders
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-Locked
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-Locked Locked
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsTab-All
wait 0.5
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort Sort: Symbol
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSortDirection
wait 0.5
investments-scroll 400
wait 0.5
capture investments-list-scrolled
# closing and opening the panel keeps the list where it was
close-economy
wait 0.5
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
expect-hidden InvestmentsPanel
investments-list off
wait 1
expect-visible InvestmentsPanel
expect-visible OwnedInvestmentsPanel
expect-visible OwnedInvestmentsSummaryPanel
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsList
cleanup:
overview-orders off
monitor restore
investments-list restore
close-economy
